      <h1>WhatsApp Multi-Number Round Robin: How to Distribute Leads Across Sales Teams (2026)</h1>
      <div class="article-meta">
        <span>By <a href="/about" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;">Nazim · Social Ninja's</a></span><span>·</span><span>Sep 28, 2026</span><span>·</span><span>7 min read</span>
      </div>
      <p class="article-intro">When your marketing campaigns scale from 10 leads a day to 100, routing all inbound inquiries into a single salesperson's phone creates a catastrophic bottleneck. Slow response times kill conversion rates. Here is how modern sales teams use <strong>WhatsApp Multi-Number Round Robin</strong> to balance workloads and double closing rates without paying for enterprise software.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

