        <strong>⚡ Need to create a multi-rep link right now?</strong> Use the <a href="/#multi-number">LinkWA Multi Number Generator</a>. Enter your team's numbers, set a default greeting, and get a single smart URL that balances leads automatically.
      </div>

      <h2>The Problem with Single-Number WhatsApp Funnels</h2>
      <p>Most small-to-medium businesses start by placing the founder's or senior sales manager's phone number on their Instagram bio, Google Ads, or website chat button. As ad spend scales, three major issues arise:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Lead Burnout & Fatigue:</strong> A single rep cannot realistically respond within 2 minutes when 15 conversations start simultaneously during peak hours.</li>
        <li><strong>Unequal Commission Disputes:</strong> Sales reps argue over manual lead redistribution and cherry-picking.</li>
        <li><strong>Single Point of Failure:</strong> If that single phone is out of battery, on vacation, or experiencing network downtime, 100% of your paid ad traffic is lost.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Why Traditional "Shared Inboxes" Don't Always Fit</h2>
      <p>Companies often look into enterprise WhatsApp Business API tools like Wati, Respond.io, or Interakt. While these tools offer deep automation, they come with substantial drawbacks for lean teams:</p>

